{"id":"3c665d756a1e2160","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-index-set.md","title":"索引集定理","display":"thm-index-set — 索引集定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-index-set","aliases":["20-thm-index-set"],"display":"thm-index-set — 索引集定理","chapter":"1","section":"1.6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 1.6.13，包括恒发散指标的方向条款","source_pdf_pages":[52],"source_printed_pages":[16],"depends_on":["[[20-df-index-set]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-index-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-index-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-index-set — 索引集定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.6.13，包括恒发散指标的方向条款"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>52</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(I\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\subsetneq I\\subsetneq\\omega\">\\(\\varnothing\\subsetneq I\\subsetneq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\omega\">\\(d\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_d(x)\\uparrow\">\\(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\varphi_d(x)\\uparrow\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" href=\"?note=f0ae2cb21680ca8b\" title=\"20-df-index-set\">20-df-index-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index-set}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nK\\le_1 I\\lor K\\le_1(\\omega\\setminus I),\\\\\nd\\notin I\\Rightarrow K\\le_1I,\\qquad\nd\\in I\\Rightarrow K\\le_1(\\omega\\setminus I).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}index-set}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nK\\le_1 I\\lor K\\le_1(\\omega\\setminus I),\\\\\nd\\notin I\\Rightarrow K\\le_1I,\\qquad\nd\\in I\\Rightarrow K\\le_1(\\omega\\setminus I).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\notin I\">\\(d\\notin I\\)</span>，非平凡性给某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in I\">\\(a\\in I\\)</span>。给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 编译程序在任意输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 上等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span> 后运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_a(y)\">\\(\\varphi_a(y)\\)</span>；不入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 就恒发散。s-m-n 与 padding 给单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span>，程序函数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_a\">\\(\\varphi_a\\)</span>，索引在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>；不入时函数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_d\">\\(\\varphi_d\\)</span>，索引不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>。索引集定义对外延等价饱和，故两方向蕴含都是等价，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\\iff f(x)\\in I\">\\(x\\in K\\iff f(x)\\in I\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in I\">\\(d\\in I\\)</span>，改取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\notin I\">\\(a\\notin I\\)</span>，同样的程序使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span> 时索引不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>、不入时索引在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>，即归约到补集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的所有同函数指标总有同一成员性，所以方向不依赖于所选恒发散码。本条恢复原书明确指定方向的附加结论；所有程序只半判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span>，未先调用停机判定。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 16 / PDF 52；补集横线按两种情形还原。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"f0ae2cb21680ca8b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-index-set]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","exce